{"ID":"20240522113005-pbg0pv5","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"1f4d1","id":"20240522113005-pbg0pv5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522113005-pbg0pv5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522113005-jkxm6xs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522123333-8akbf57\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522123333-8akbf57\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"各種病症研究區","type":"doc","updated":"20240522123333"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522113005-jkxm6xs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522113005-jkxm6xs","updated":"20240522113017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我特別開設一個區塊給讀者，將歷年來有關各種癌症的報導與研究，統一歸為一個區塊，這樣讀者就可以很迅速的看到所有有關同一癌症的訊息而不必到處去找相關的報導與研究，將歷年來所有的資訊集中在一起的做法，更可以讓讀者看清楚西藥廠的真面貌所在，我需要一點時間來完成這個網頁，敬請拭目以待。"}]},{"ID":"20240522113017-164h5na","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522113017-164h5na"}},{"ID":"20240522122913-zorto2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522122913-zorto2u"}},{"ID":"20240522122913-jlak0k8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522122913-jlak0k8","updated":"20240522123333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"作者的话：多出自时事评论，故与时事评论有内容重叠，属于正常现象。"}]},{"ID":"20240522123333-8akbf57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522123333-8akbf57"}}]}